      "summary": "The javac failure is not a setup problem. Tomcat 10.0.0 moved to Jakarta EE 9, so tomcat-embed-el 10.0.0 ships `jakarta.el.*` instead of `javax.el.*`. The 9.0.83 tests still import `javax.el.*` and can't compile against the 10.0.0 jar. The 10.0.0 tests need to be generated against the `jakarta.el` API, and the artifact already provides everything they need, so no extra dependency, Docker image, or system property is needed. I did not open the 10.0.0 jar or the repository, so this rests on knowledge of the Tomcat 10 namespace change.",
